<title>CROATIA: Croatia, Greece sign cooperation agreements.</title>
<headline>Croatia, Greece sign cooperation agreements.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The foreign ministers of Greece and Croatia signed agreements in Zagreb on Friday on investment protection, taxation and road traffic, the Croatian news agency HINA reported.</p>
<p>It quoted Greece's Theodhoros Pangalos and Croatia's Mate Granic as saying that the agreements would promote good and stable relations between their countries.</p>
<p>Pangalos later met President Franjo Tudjman.</p>
</text>
